[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    155[0m:[38;5;10m[49m     MixedDenormalNormal,
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    156[0m:[38;5;10m[49m     /// Near FLT_MAX, so `sum` overflows to +inf.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    157[0m:[38;5;10m[49m     NearMax,
