[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    159[0m:[38;5;10m[49m     InfSprinkle,
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    160[0m:[38;5;10m[49m     /// Mostly finite, with random-payload NaNs sprinkled in.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    161[0m:[38;5;10m[49m     NanSprinkle,
